# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# The OAuth review requires these pages to be publicly indexable, so nothing here may emit
# X-Robots-Tag: noindex. Note that Pages PREVIEW deployments add that header automatically —
# only the production deployment on the custom domain is used as the declared URL.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
